---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms"
  description="Don't use Gridwatch to guess future electricity prices, or to decide if the power system is safe. Gridwatch can get things wrong."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <div class="split" role="group" aria-label="What this data is for">
      <div class="ok">
        <p class="label">Use this for</p>
        <p>Looking at a day that has already finished.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="no">
        <p class="label">Don't use this for</p>
        <p>
          Guessing future prices, or deciding if the power system is safe.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2>Forecasting</h2>
    <p>
      Don't use this data for forecasting. Forecasting means guessing what
      electricity prices will do next, or how much power the country will use
      or make. Gridwatch looks at what already happened.
    </p>
    <h2>Safety and operations</h2>
    <p>
      Gridwatch isn't a safety tool. Don't use it to decide whether the power
      system is safe, or when and how to run a power station. A wrong number
      here could hurt people or the power system.
    </p>
    <p>
      Gridwatch is independent. It isn't the Electricity Authority, the
      government body that sets the rules for the electricity market, and it
      isn't the grid operator, the people who keep the lights on.
    </p>
    <p>
      The numbers come from EMI, the Authority's public electricity data, and
      Gridwatch can still get things wrong. If you need an official figure,
      get it from EMI.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: var(--measure-prose);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .split > div {
    background: var(--color-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .ok {
    box-shadow: inset 0 4px 0 var(--color-brand);
  }

  .no {
    box-shadow: inset 0 4px 0 var(--color-caution);
  }

  .label {
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
</style>
